1
00:00:00,370 --> 00:00:01,620
[BOLLYWOOD FILM PLAYING ON TV]

2
00:00:01,788 --> 00:00:02,828
[KNOCKING ON DOOR]

3
00:00:02,998 --> 00:00:04,578
(Raj:)It's open.

4
00:00:05,917 --> 00:00:07,877
(Howard:)Hey, pal.

5
00:00:09,296 --> 00:00:11,086
(Raj:)What do you want?

6
00:00:11,256 --> 00:00:12,926
(Howard:)I brought you a little gift.

7
00:00:13,592 --> 00:00:15,422
(Howard:)New kite.

8
00:00:16,970 --> 00:00:19,760
(Raj:)The kite you made me lose
was an authentic Patang.

9
00:00:19,931 --> 00:00:22,431
An Indian kite my brother sent
to me from New Delhi.

10
00:00:22,601 --> 00:00:25,891
(Raj:)It took me a day to put together
and two days to paint.

11
00:00:26,062 --> 00:00:28,312
(Raj:)This is Hello Kitty.

12
00:00:30,776 --> 00:00:34,236
(Howard:)Yeah, but it comes
with a little coin purse.

13
00:00:34,404 --> 00:00:36,444
(Howard:)Does a Patang?

14
00:00:37,240 --> 00:00:39,070
(Raj:)Wow, you just don't get it, do you?

15
00:00:39,242 --> 00:00:43,372
Buying me something pretty isn't gonna
make our problem just go away.

16
00:00:44,831 --> 00:00:48,541
(Howard:)Look, I admit I haven't always been
the best friend I could be.

17
00:00:48,710 --> 00:00:51,800
(Raj:)You've been a sucky friend.
A sucky, sucky friend.

18
00:00:52,214 --> 00:00:54,674
(Howard:)-Stipulated.
-And you do it all the time.

19
00:00:54,841 --> 00:00:59,051
Last week, we were looking for a phone
with giant numbers for your mother...

